                    Distribution. Drafted and approved by Robertson who signed for Dulles.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d140-f2" n="2" xml:id="d140-f2-content">
                <p>Frank T. Bow of Ohio, a member of the House Appropriations Committee.</p>
